@startuml AnySpark v4 - Sequence: Chat Flow
!theme plain
title AnySpark v4 — 顺序图：主对话流程（Chat Flow）
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User
participant "FastAPI\n/app.py" as API
participant "Agent\n/core.loop" as Agent
participant "ModelProvider\n/models.registry" as MP
participant "DeepSeekModel\n/models.deepseek" as DSM
participant "ToolRegistry\n/core.protocol" as TR
participant "SqliteConversationStore\n/store.sqlite" as Store
participant "EventEmitter\n/core.events" as EE
participant "TokenBudget\n/server.context" as TB

== 用户发起对话 ==
User -> API: POST /api/chat\n{message, conversation_id?}
API -> Store: get(conversation_id)\n或 create()
Store --> API: Conversation

API -> Agent: Agent.run(user_prompt, conversation_id)

== Agent 循环开始 ==
loop 每轮迭代（max_tool_iterations 次）
  Agent -> Store: append(user_msg)
  Agent -> EE: emit(user_text)

  Agent -> Store: messages(conversation_id)
  Store --> Agent: history

  opt 上下文压缩
    Agent -> TB: compress(prompt_messages)
    TB --> Agent: compressed_messages
  end

  Agent -> MP: respond(prompt_messages, tools)
  MP -> DSM: build().respond(...)
  DSM -> DSM: OpenAI API 调用
  DSM --> MP: ModelOutput
  MP --> Agent: ModelOutput{text, tool_calls}

  alt 无工具调用（终答）
    Agent -> Store: append(assistant_msg)
    Agent -> EE: emit(text)
    Agent -> EE: emit(done)
    Agent --> API: Turn{text}
  else 有工具调用
    Agent -> Store: append(assistant_msg\nwith tool_calls metadata)
    Agent -> EE: emit(tool_call)

    loop 每个工具调用（并行/串行）
      Agent -> EE: emit(tool_execution_start)
      Agent -> TR: execute(registry, call)
      TR -> TR: validate + implementer()
      TR --> Agent: ToolResult
      Agent -> Store: append(tool_result_msg)
      Agent -> EE: emit(tool_execution_end)
      Agent -> EE: emit(tool_result)
    end

    opt 全部 terminate=True
      Agent -> Store: append(终止消息)
      Agent -> EE: emit(done)
      Agent --> API: Turn{终止}
    end
  end
end

API --> User: ChatResponse\n{text, conversation_id}

== SSE 流式变体 ==
User -> API: POST /api/chat/stream
API -> Agent: Agent.run() (in thread)
loop 事件循环
  Agent -> EE: emit(text_delta / toolcall_delta)
  EE --> API: SSE frame
  API --> User: text/event-stream\ndata: {...}
end

== 运行中插话 ==
User -> API: POST /api/chat/steer\n{text}
API -> Agent: agent.steer(text)
Agent -> Agent: steer_queue.put(msg)
note right: 在当前轮工具结果后、\n下一轮 LLM 前注入

== 取消 ==
User -> API: POST /api/chat/cancel
API -> Agent: token.cancel()
Agent -> Agent: 检查 is_cancelled()
Agent -> Store: append(abort_msg)
Agent -> EE: emit(aborted)
Agent -> EE: emit(done)
Agent --> API: Turn{已中断}

@enduml
